---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.ts';
---

<Layout title="Contact" description={`Report a bug, a subtitle file problem, or a tool request to ${site.name}.`}>
  <article class="doc">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Report a bug, a file that will not open, or a useful tool idea at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
    <p>These details help find the cause quickly:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Which tool you used, for example the <a href="/subtitle-shifter">subtitle shifter</a></li>
      <li>The file's format and, if you know it, its language or encoding</li>
      <li>What you expected and what happened instead, including any warning the page showed</li>
      <li>Your browser and device</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Please describe the problem first. Don't attach subtitle files unless we ask, and never send files you aren't allowed to share.</p>
    <h2>Requests</h2>
    <p>Missing a format, an option or a whole tool? Say what you're trying to do and with which files.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
